d="01:51.990"><span begin="01:48.300" end="01:48.990">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.990" end="01:49.140">just </span><span begin="01:49.140" end="01:49.710">gonna </span><span begin="01:49.710" end="01:50.250">keep </span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:50.580">on </span><span begin="01:50.580" end="01:51.990">waiting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.990" end="01:54.570"><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:52.800">Underneath </span><span begin="01:52.800" end="01:52.920">the </span><span begin="01:52.920" end="01:54.540">mistletoe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.570" end="01:57.870"><span begin="01:54.570" end="01:55.110">I </span><span begin="01:55.110" end="01:55.380">won't </span><span begin="01:55.380" end="01:56.010">make </span><span begin="01:56.010" end="01:56.100">a </span><span begin="01:56.100" end="01:56.670">list </span><span begin="01:56.670" end="01:56.910">and </span><span begin="01:56.910" end="01:57.420">send </span><span begin="01:57.420" end="01:57.870">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.870" end="02:01.140"><span begin="01:57.870" end="01:58.320">To </span><span begin="01:58.320" end="01:58.500">the </span><span begin="01:58.500" end="01:58.980">North </span><span begin="01:58.980" end="01:59.340">Pole </span><span begin="01:59.340" end="01:59.670">for </span><span begin="01:59.670" end="02:00.150">Saint </span><span begin="02:00.150" end="02:01.020">Nick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.140" end="02:04.710"><span begin="02:01.140" end="02:01.710">I </span><span begin="02:01.710" end="02:01.980">won't </span><span begin="02:01.980" end="02:02.430">even </span><span begin="02:02.430" end="02:03.030">stay </span><span begin="02:03.030" end="02:03.780">awake </span><span begin="02:03.780" end="02:04.710">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.710" end="02:07.350"><span begin="02:04.710" end="02:05.010">Hear </span><span begin="02:05.010" end="02:05.100">those </span><span begin="02:05.100" end="02:05.730">magic </